# Maps retired URLs to their nearest surviving page (Cloudflare Pages redirect format)
# Each retired section needs BOTH a bare and a splat rule: a splat only matches after
# the trailing slash, so `/photos` alone would fall through to a 404 without the bare rule.
/photos / 301
/photos/* / 301
/ai-workflow / 301
/ai-workflow/* / 301
/blog/welcome /blog/ 301
/blog/vite-plugins /blog/ 301
